Section: Helpers

  bytes-eq : List Integer, List Integer -> Boolean
  bytes-eq (a) (b) =
    if list-length a /= list-length b then False
    else bytes-eq-loop a b 0

  bytes-eq-loop : List Integer, List Integer, Integer -> Boolean
  bytes-eq-loop (a) (b) (i) =
    if i >= list-length a then True
    else if list-at a i /= list-at b i then False
    else bytes-eq-loop a b (i + 1)

 A digest of the answer, printed beside the verdict so a wrong result is
 visible as a number rather than only as the word False.

  sum-of : List Integer -> Integer
  sum-of (bs) = sum-loop bs 0 0

  sum-loop : List Integer, Integer, Integer -> Integer
  sum-loop (bs) (i) (acc) =
    if i >= list-length bs then acc
    else sum-loop bs (i + 1) (acc + list-at bs i * (i + 1))

Section: The Small Case

 Small enough to check by hand: 5^3 is 125, and 125 modulo 13 is 8.

  small : List Integer = cb-mod-exp-bytes [5] [3] [13]

Section: The Real Case

  got : List Integer = cb-mod-exp-bytes v-base [1, 0, 1] v-mod

Section: Body

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni ("small 5^3 mod 13 = " & show (list-at small 0))
    print-line-uni ("rsa width = " & show (list-length got))
    print-line-uni ("rsa checksum = " & show (sum-of got))
    print-line-uni ("rsa matches oracle = " & show (bytes-eq got v-want))
  end

